{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-density-pointwise","title":"def:riemannian-density-pointwise","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":2064,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:riemannian-density-pointwise","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:density-pointwise]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-metric]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:riemannian-density-pointwise","line":3312,"source":"\\begin{definition}[The Riemannian Density, Pointwise]\n\\label{def:riemannian-density-pointwise}\n\n\\uses{def:density-pointwise, def:riemannian-metric}\n\n\n\n\nFor a Riemannian manifold $(M,g)$, define the pointwise density by\n\\[\n\\mu_x(v_1,\\ldots,v_n)=\\sqrt{\\det(\\langle v_i,v_j\\rangle_g)_{i,j=1}^n}.\n\\]\nThis uses no orientation.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[The Riemannian Density, Pointwise] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a7269656d616e6e69616e2d64656e736974792d706f696e7477697365\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Adensity-pointwise\">↗ def:density-pointwise</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ariemannian-metric\">↗ def:riemannian-metric</a> <p></p>For a Riemannian manifold <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(M,g)$\">$(M,g)$</span>, define the pointwise density by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\mu _x(v_1,\\ldots ,v_n)=\\sqrt{\\det (\\langle v_i,v_j\\rangle _g)_{i,j=1}^n}.  \\]\">\\[  \\mu _x(v_1,\\ldots ,v_n)=\\sqrt{\\det (\\langle v_i,v_j\\rangle _g)_{i,j=1}^n}.  \\]</span> This uses no orientation. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-density","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:density-smooth","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:density-pointwise","title":"def:density-pointwise","label":"def:density-pointwise"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-metric","title":"def:riemannian-metric","label":"def:riemannian-metric"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:density-smooth","title":"prop:density-smooth","label":"prop:density-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:riemannian-density","title":"prop:riemannian-density","label":"prop:riemannian-density"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-density-pointwise","title":"def:riemannian-density-pointwise","tex":"\\begin{definition}[The Riemannian Density, Pointwise]\n\\label{def:riemannian-density-pointwise}\n\n\\uses{def:density-pointwise, def:riemannian-metric}\n\n\n\n\nFor a Riemannian manifold $(M,g)$, define the pointwise density by\n\\[\n\\mu_x(v_1,\\ldots,v_n)=\\sqrt{\\det(\\langle v_i,v_j\\rangle_g)_{i,j=1}^n}.\n\\]\nThis uses no orientation.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:density-pointwise","title":"def:density-pointwise","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-metric","title":"def:riemannian-metric","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0